description: Split compound components into folders with one file per subcomponent
globs: src/components/**/*.{ts,tsx}
alwaysApply: true
---

# Component file structure

When a component file defines a main component **and** one or more subcomponents, split them into a folder named after the parent.

```
components/layout/sidebar/
  sidebar.tsx      # Sidebar
  nav-link.tsx     # NavLink (internal)
  index.ts         # public exports only
```

- One component per file.
- Export public pieces from `index.ts`.
- Do **not** export internals used only by the parent (e.g. `NavLink`).
- Keep single, self-contained components as a single file (no forced folder).
